	"description": "Brenda has waited 47 minutes. A sitcom cold open in a drawn office: three coding agents, one polite approval nobody saw, six terminal tabs. Then the real Agents dock in Insilode, a code editor built on VS Code: every agent in one list, the one that needs you first, with the exact text it is asking, and the optional status island with a face per agent. Demo project (Harbor Goods); the dock and island are the app's own pages on demo agents, with the demo clock moved forward 45 minutes so the wait reads 47. The office and its characters are drawn; the pets are the dock's real avatars. Voice: synthetic (AI-generated). Music composed in code. Free and open source: insilode.dev",
